  m_text: '1. Implemented a keycode so that the user can press r to restart the level
    while the game over panel is open.

    2. Added support for discord rich presence.

    3.
    The cursor will now be hidden while you play the game, and it will be visible
    again only when needed.

    4. Added an options menu.

    5. Added sounds to
    the game.'
